        "text": "Gregory Silbert argued that comity\u2011based abstention has been recognized since 1885 and that a federal court may decline jurisdiction in favor of a foreign tribunal when a complaint involves foreign parties harming other foreign parties abroad."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Gregory Silbert",
