              "start": 5
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Gregory Silbert, the FSIA\u2019s text concerns only sovereign immunity and does not affect prudential doctrines such as comity\u2011based abstention."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Mr. Silbert",
        "citations": [
